{"about_the_game":"You are an ordinary blacksmith in an extraordinary world. While heroes fight monsters, it\u2019s you who forges their weapons.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Craft weapons with dozens of unique combinations: from blood tempering to engravings of ancient runes and inlays of magical stones.<br></li><li> Match combinations against monsters\u2019 weaknesses and equip heroes with what will help them survive\u2026 or not.<br></li><li> Trade with local merchants.<br></li><li> Improve your reputation so that wealthier characters will come to you.<br></li><li> Upgrade your forge, unlocking new stations and recipes.</li></ul><br>The lives of heroes \u2014 and the entire kingdom \u2014 depend on your choices!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916470?t=1758045014","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/021ad7f7172afae351de9dd778f3aa6905ca02c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758045014","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/80e20416112792496b9418a3e2afb2992d88fe61/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758045014","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916470/80e20416112792496b9418a3e2afb2992d88fe61/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758045014","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"You are an ordinary blacksmith in an extraordinary world. While heroes fight monsters, it\u2019s you who forges their weapons.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Craft weapons with dozens of unique combinations: from blood tempering to engravings of ancient runes and inlays of magical stones.<br></li><li> Match combinations against monsters\u2019 weaknesses and equip heroes with what will help them survive\u2026 or not.<br></li><li> Trade with local merchant